# image 1
Style: Chinese Ink Wash (Sumi-e)
Aspect Ratio: 16:9
Chinese ink wash painting, sumi-e style. A quiet tea evaluation table: spent tea leaves, fully unfurled and glistening wet, spread out flat across a shallow white porcelain tray. Beside it an open gaiwan with its lid resting upside down, a few dark leaves laid on the lid. Soft daylight from the left. Muted green, copper and grey ink tones, wet brush strokes on rice paper, generous negative space, calm and observational. No text, no lettering.
